{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Operation HOPE is a top-down tower defense game with comic-style visuals and a ridiculous amount of zombies.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Plan your defense carefully</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Because once the horde hits, there\u2019s no time to think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/1.gif?t=1749484629\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Face endless waves of mutated zombies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From tank-like giants to swarmers that bite your ankles off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/2.gif?t=1749484629\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build turrets, trigger traps, and survive the chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This isn\u2019t chess. It\u2019s comic-book carnage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/4_slowed.gif?t=1749484629\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Stylized visuals straight out of a war-torn comic book</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A colorful, chaotic battlefield \u2014 drawn with attitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/4.gif?t=1749484629\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play your way</strong>\u00a0 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story mode or endless rogue-like chaos.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3475430?t=1749484629","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/4d980af4a3d9a5fe224fb922fe0941ad9792fdf1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749484629","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/5ef